<title>JAPAN: Kobe Elec Railway to issue 8 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Kobe Elec Railway to issue 8 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Kobe Electric Railway Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nikko Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Sakura Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   2	  AMT   8 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 30.Sep.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Jul.97   CONV TO 29.Sep.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 23.May.97  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 16.May-22.May</p>
<p> LAST JCR   BBB	 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on May 15.</p>
</text>
